{"title":"Titanium Dagger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 46) · Monster drop: Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Mauler, Thak Footman, Virikh, Ogre Charger +10 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · DEX 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Dagger</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-the-mercy-knives\">The Mercy Knives</a></b> (Warden Maud Ferrow, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good, or study a <b>Dagger tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2109 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 4 of 63 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Virikh Dragonslayer - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7d40b95a4d9390b47b9c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Dragonslayer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-wyrmling\" title=\"Sand Wyrmling - dropped it in 1 of 24 looted corpses (1/24)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ca7435ecfe8bb6141971.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Wyrmling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 2 of 62 looted corpses (1/31)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/31<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+11 more\">+11 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 3 of 174 looted corpses (1/58)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/58<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 1 of 61 looted corpses (1/61)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/61<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 1 of 63 looted corpses (1/63)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/63<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"mummy\" title=\"Mummy - dropped it in 1 of 65 looted corpses (1/65)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mummy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/65<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 4 of 383 looted corpses (1/96)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/96<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 3 of 313 looted corpses (1/104)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/104<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 1 of 176 looted corpses (1/176)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/176<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 2 of 639 looted corpses (1/320)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/320<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 3 of 1,131 looted corpses (1/377)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/377<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 3 of 1,185 looted corpses (1/395)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/395<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 1 of 593 looted corpses (1/593)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/593<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"titanium-dagger\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=crude\">Crude <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-good\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=good\">Good <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"titanium-dagger\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>7.3–14.7 damage</td><td>-4.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>8.4–16.8 damage</td><td>-3.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>9.4–18.9 damage</td><td>-1.6 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-dagger?